WEBVTT

00:00:00.702 --> 00:00:06.200
From the start page create a "Parametric Body": Part Design workbench with one Body

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:13.500
Click "Create sketch" and choose the XY plane

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.301
Circle tool: click the centre (the origin), type diameter 16, press Enter

00:00:19.301 --> 00:00:24.525
The tool is still active: draw the bore, centre at the origin again, diameter 8

00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:30.150
The panel says "Fully constrained" (green): both circles are fixed in place and size

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:41.101
Close the sketch, select it, click "Pad" and type a length of 3 mm

00:00:41.101 --> 00:00:47.720
Presser-bar collar: OD 16, bore 8, 3 thick — the same as in the WQ-LS design
